config HW75_UART_COMM
	bool "HW-75 UART companion link (SLIP)"
	depends on SERIAL
	select HW75_PROTO_UART_COMM
	help
	  Enable the UART-based companion link used to talk to the host
	  configuration tool over a SLIP-attached UART. Off by default in
	  this ZMK 4.x build; enable explicitly if your board's keymap or
	  companion tooling requires it.
